{"id":"vod_hh_48976","vodId":"48976","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"魔术快斗","name_cn":"魔术快斗","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第12集","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/4a6691c609e4d04769c91b4b6f2d5358.jpg"},"summary":"白色斗篷、高礼帽，单片夹鼻眼镜。出现在午夜的高楼，留下拿走宝石的通知函。这是我们熟知的怪盗基德。在《名侦探柯南》里，他是不亚于工藤新一和江户川柯南的明星人物。而他的真实身份则是高中生黑羽快斗（山口胜平 配音），为了调查父亲的失踪事件，扮起了父亲之前扮演的角色——怪盗基德，希望引出神秘组织的出现，进而调查出事情的真相。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-05-30 17:17:12","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/pen7ROWa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lej5Y8Pd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/pen7RO7a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lej5Y8vd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Ddw20K8b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepBZkVb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nelXR2Me/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lej5Y0vd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Rb4V6zxe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZv885e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/BeXqQQga/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/qaQjkk9b/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:46:12.342Z"}